				Time="2011-10-21T05:37:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>メカポリス『照合　完了▼
連続強盗犯　[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]ニンジャ
