				Time="2011-11-10T11:47:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]ニンジャ『メカポリス！
オレを　逃がしたことを▽
一生　後悔　しやがれ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-11-10T11:47:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
