		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>メカポリス『おのれ！
許さんぞ　[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]ニン……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-21T13:14:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
